// title: "Highway domain catalogue"
// summary: "Generate domain navigation and collection membership from registered sources; subject records remain authoritative."
//
// Used when: Contributors inspect the generated highway catalogue totals, subordinate inventory locations, and named collection membership after an inventory refresh; the current domain has zero pieces and zero assemblies.
//
// Read by: Contributors and catalogue validation tests inspect this generated view; custom-pieces/framework/scp/catalog.py load_catalog() reads domain.jsonc, collections.jsonc, and registered subject sources rather than using this file as build input.
//
// Updated by: custom-pieces/framework/scp/inventory.py write_inventories(), invoked by python3 -B custom-pieces/scp.py inventory and by relevant documentation refreshes, derives this payload from the current catalogue while retaining its leading comments.
//
// Affects: A machine-readable navigation view of the highway domain; its piece_inventory and assembly_inventory fields point to the two generated child catalogues, and editing this view does not register subjects or change authoritative test observations.
//
// Reference: custom-pieces/docs/WORKFLOW_DOCUMENTATION_GENERATION.md
{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "purpose": "Generated domain navigation and collection membership; subject test records remain authoritative.",
  "version": "0.6.0.dev1",
  "domain": "highway",
  "count": 0,
  "assembly_count": 0,
  "piece_inventory": "00_pieces/inventory.jsonc",
  "assembly_inventory": "01_assemblies/inventory.jsonc",
  "piece_sets": {}
}
